      "content": "idk, i've had gas like this before and it usually goes away with some advil. it's not even that sharp yet, just a nagging feeling. i'm pretty sure a doctor would just tell me it's indigestion and charge me $500 for nothing lol. you're sure it's not something serious since it's only been a few hours? i'd rather just dose up on some ibuprofen and wait until morning.",
