      "content": "i mean yeah i know i should be cautious but i'm really trying to avoid the hospital. if i take like 800mg of ibuprofen right now, will that definitely settle it down so i can just sleep through the night? i'm feeling a bit nauseous too, but i figure that's just part of the indigestion. if i just take a high dose, can i be pretty sure it's just gas and nothing else?",
